  <XCOM_Skyranger_Blueprint.label>Skyranger</XCOM_Skyranger_Blueprint.label>
  <!-- EN: The Skyranger is a Vertical Take-Off and Landing (VTOL) troop transport aircraft which utilizes swiveling engines on either side of the fuselage to provide all the lifting power, in addition to the large main forward thruster.\n\nIt is significantly faster and more fuel-efficient than the industrial-era counterparts and its plasteel hull makes it resistant to small-arms fire, though the lack of armaments prevents it from acting in an aerial combat role. -->
  <XCOM_Skyranger_Blueprint.description>“天行者”是一款垂直起降（VTOL）部队运输机，除前方的大型主推进器外，还利用机身两侧的可旋转发动机提供全部升力。

它比工业时代的同类机型速度更快、燃油效率更高，其塑钢机身使其能够抵御小口径武器的射击，但由于缺乏武器装备，它无法承担空中作战任务。</XCOM_Skyranger_Blueprint.description>
